  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="33" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G5108">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G4183">With many such</char> <char style="w" strong="G3850">parables</char> <char style="w" strong="G2980">[Jesus] spoke</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3056">word</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">to them</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2531">to the extent that</char> <char style="w" strong="G1410">they could</char> <char style="w" strong="G191">understand</char>. <verse style="v" number="34" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2980">He did not tell them [anything]</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G5565">without using</char> <char style="w" strong="G3850">a parable</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1161">But</char> <char style="w" strong="G2596">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2398">privately</char> <char style="w" strong="G1956">He explained</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">everything</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">to His</char> <char style="w" strong="G2398">own</char> <char style="w" strong="G3101">disciples</char>.</para>
