  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="14" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">Now</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G935">King</char> <char style="w" strong="G2264">Herod</char> <char style="w" strong="G191">heard about this</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1063">for</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">[Jesus’]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3686">name</char> <char style="w" strong="G1096">had become</char> <char style="w" strong="G5318">well known</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G2036">[people] were saying</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">-</char>,<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">6:14 </char><char style="ft">Literally </char><char style="fqa">they were saying</char><char style="ft">; some manuscripts </char><char style="fqa">he was saying</char></note> “<char style="w" strong="G2491">John</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G907">Baptist</char> <char style="w" strong="G1453">has risen</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">from</char> <char style="w" strong="G3498">[the] dead</char>! <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3778">That</char> <char style="w" strong="G1223">is why</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1411">miraculous powers</char> <char style="w" strong="G1754">are at work</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">him</char>.” <verse style="v" number="15" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G243">Others</char> <char style="w" strong="G2036">were saying</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3754">-</char> “<char style="w" strong="G1510">He is</char> <char style="w" strong="G2243">Elijah</char>,” <char style="w" strong="G1161">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G243">still others</char> <char style="w" strong="G2036">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">-</ch