har style="w" strong="G5108">so</char> <char style="w" strong="G4183">in many</char> <char style="w" strong="G3946">such [matters]</char>.”</char></para>
  <para style="s1">What Defiles a Man</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matthew 15:10–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="14" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3825">Once again</char> <char style="w" strong="G4341">[Jesus] called</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3793">crowd [to Him]</char> <char style="w" strong="G2036">[and] said</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">-</char>, <char style="wj">“<char style="w" strong="G3956">All of you</char>, <char style="w" strong="G191">listen to</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">Me</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G4920">understand</char>: <verse style="v" number="15" /><char style="w" strong="G3762">Nothing</char> <char style="w" strong="G1531">that enters</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">a</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">man</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1855">from the outside</char> <char style="w" strong="G3739">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1410">can</char> <char style="w" strong="G2840">defile</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">him</char>; <char style="w" strong="G235">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the things</char> <char style="w" strong="G1607">that come</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">out of</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">a</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">man</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1510">these are</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">what</char> <char style="w" strong="G2840">defile</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">[him]</char>.”</char><note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">7:15 </char><char style="ft">BYZ and TR include </char><char style="fqa"><char style="fv">16</char>If anyone has ears to hear, let him hear.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="17" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3753">After</char> <char style="w" strong="G1525">[Jesus] had left</char> <char style="w" strong="G575">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3793">crowd</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">[and gone] into</char> <char style="w" strong="G3624">[the] house</char>, <char style="w" strong="G846">His</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3101">disciples</char> <char style="w" strong="G1905">inquired about</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3850">parable</char>.</para>
  <para style="p"><char style="wj"> <verse style="v" number="18" />“<char style="w" strong="G1510">Are</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">still</char> <char style="w" strong="G3779">so</char> <char style="w" strong="G801">dull</char>?”</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3004">He asked</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">-</char>. <char style="wj">“<char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3539">Do you not understand</char>? <char style="w" strong="G3754">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">Nothing</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G1531">enters</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">a</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">man</char> <char style="w" strong="G1855">from the outside</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G1410">can</char> <char style="w" strong="G2840">defile</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">him</char>, <verse style="v" number="19" /><char style="w" strong="G3754">because</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G1531">it does not enter</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">his</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2588">heart</char>, <char style="w" strong="G235">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">[it goes] into</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2836">stomach</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and then</char> <char style="w" strong="G1607">is eliminated</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G856">. . .</char>.”</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">([Thus] all</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1033">foods</char> <char style="w" strong="G2511">are clean</char>.)<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">7:19 </char><char style="ft">Or </char><char style="fqa">and then is eliminated, thereby expelling all foods.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="20" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2036">He continued</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">-</char>: <char style="wj">“<char style="w" strong="G3588">What</char> <char style="w" strong="G1607">comes</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">out of</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">a</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">man</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1565">that [is what]</char> <char style="w" strong="G2840">defiles</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">[him]</char>. <verse style="v" number="21" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">from</char> <char style="w" strong="G2081">within</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2588">hearts</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">of men</char> <char style="w" strong="G1607">come</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2556">evil</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1261">thoughts</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4202">sexual immorality</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2829">theft</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5408">murder</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3430">adultery</char>,<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">7:21 </char><char style="ft">Many texts move </char><char style="fqa">adultery </char><char style="ft">to verse 22.</char></note> <verse style="v" number="22" /><char style="w" strong="G4124">greed</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4189">wickedness</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1388">deceit</char>, <char style="w" strong="G766">debauchery</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3788">envy</char> <char style="w" strong="G4190">. . .</char>, <char style="w" strong="G988">slander</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5243">arrogance</char>, <char style="w" strong="G877">[and] foolishness</char>. <verse style="v" number="23" /><char style="w" strong="G3956">All</char> <char style="w" strong="G3778">these</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4190">evils</char> <char style="w" strong="G1607">come</char> <char style="w" strong="G2081">from within</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G2840">[these are what] defile</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">a</char> <char style="w" strong="G444">man</char>.”</char></para>
  <para style="s1">The Faith of the Gentile Woman</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matthew 15:21–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="24" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G450">[Jesus] left</char> <char style="w" strong="G1564">that place</char> <char style="w" strong="G565">[and] went</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3725">region</char> <char style="w" strong="G5184">of Tyre</char>.<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">7:24 </char><char style="ft">WH, BYZ, and TR include </char><char style="fqa">and Sidon</char><char style="ft">; see <ref loc="MAT 15:21">Matthew 15:21</ref>.</char></note> <char style="w" strong="G2309">Not wanting anyone</char> <char style="w" strong="G3762">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G1097">to know [He was there]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1525">He entered</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3614">[a] house</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G1410">was unable</char> <char style="w" strong="G2990">to escape their notice</char>. <verse style="v" number="25" /><char style="w" strong="G235">Instead</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1135">a woman</char> <char style="w" strong="G3739">whose</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2365">little daughter</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G2192">had</char> <char style="w" strong="G169">[an] unclean</char> <char style="w" strong="G4151">spirit</char> <char style="w" strong="G2112">soon</char> <char style="w" strong="G191">heard</char> <char style="w" strong="G4012">about</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">Jesus</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2064">[and] she came</char> <char style="w" strong="G4363">[and] fell</char> <char style="w" strong="G4314">at</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">His</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-<