  <para style="p"><char style="w" strong="G2532">So</char> <char style="w" strong="G5455">they called</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G5185">blind [man]</char>. “<char style="w" strong="G2293">Take courage</char>!” <char style="w" strong="G3004">they said</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">. . .</char>. “<char style="w" strong="G1453">Get up</char>! <char style="w" strong="G5455">He is calling for</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char>.”</para>
