  <para style="s1">The Triumphal Entry</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ZEC 9:9-13">Zechariah 9:9–13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matthew 21:1–11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luke 19:28–40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">John 12:12–19</ref>)</para>
