. .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3004">I tell</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3956">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3745">whatever</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G154">you ask for</char> <char style="w" strong="G4336">in prayer</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4100">believe</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G2983">you have received [it]</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">and [it]</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">will be</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">yours</char>.</char></para>
